{"author":{"id":"b409816c5cd5ab140d1d52eb33aace35de44952bb794b19806fd57f6ecb1ace9"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1790259167,"nonce":"QVZCm5SxX7+igOkvaCAdKku3dtE=","title":"Builtins: zb_json_into reads zb_box_get_bool as a Bool; LLVM rejects the module","message":"zb_json_into called zb_box_get_bool as returning Bool while its extern\nreturns i32. The LLVM verifier rejects the function (\"Branch condition\nis not 'i1' type\"), so with ZYPY_LLVM=1 json_bench's serialiser never\nreaches the LLVM tier:\n\n    [TieredBackend] LLVM compile failed: ... LLVM module verification failed (pre-opt): Branch condition is not 'i1' type!\n      br i32 %call289, ...\n      %call289 = call i32 @zyntax_box_get_bool(ptr %param_1)\n\nFix: compare the i32 against zero, and check in zyntax_builtins that\nevery call's result type is its callee's declared return type (a\ndebug_assert where the library is built and a unit test), which reports\nthis call as `zb_json_into: zb_box_get_bool declared Primitive(I32),\ncalled as Primitive(Bool)`.","files":null}]}